# Submission scope

This repo’s **in-scope apps** are only:

1. `backend/12-file-upload` — File Upload API
2. `backend/02-auth-workflow/backend` — Auth API
3. `backend/02-auth-workflow/frontend` — Auth UI
4. `ai/07-ticket-classifier` — Ticket classifier (CLI + HTTP)

Those trees were deleted from the repo. Do not recreate inventory, catalog, job-board, or `backend/platform-api` unless the user explicitly asks.

## Live URLs

- Auth UI: https://manusmriti-auth-ui.vercel.app
- Auth API: https://manusmriti-auth-api.vercel.app
- Upload API: https://manusmriti-upload-api.vercel.app
- Ticket classifier: https://manusmriti-ticket-classifier.vercel.app

## Deploy / secrets

- Do not read `.env` or `.env.local`. Use Vercel env names only.
- Classifier providers: Gemini → Groq → OpenAI. `GROQ_API_KEY` is the fallback when OpenAI is unavailable.
- Leave the three official packets in the repo root unchanged if present.

